    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "RAM disponible",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "**Ce que ça mesure.** La part de mémoire vive encore utilisable sur le VPS (12 Go au total).\n\n**Comment.** node-exporter (conteneur du VPS) lit les compteurs du système Linux ; le Prometheus du VPS les relève toutes les 15 s. Calcul : mémoire disponible / mémoire totale.\n\n**Lecture.** Vert ≥ 25 % · orange ≥ 10 % · rouge en dessous : l'alerte « RAM critique » se déclenche après 2 min sous 10 %.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes * 100",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 25
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Disque /data libre",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "**Ce que ça mesure.** La part d'espace libre sur le volume de données (bases, artefacts MLflow, images Docker, logs).\n\n**Comment.** node-exporter (conteneur du VPS) lit les compteurs du système Linux ; le Prometheus du VPS les relève toutes les 15 s.\n\n**Lecture.** Vert ≥ 30 % · orange ≥ 15 % · rouge en dessous : l'alerte « Disque /data critique » se déclenche après 2 min sous 15 %.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"/data\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"/data\"} * 100",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 15
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 30
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
