      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cockpit admin (Tailscale)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "**Ce que ça mesure.** Le Cockpit d'administration répond-il ?\n\n**Comment.** Le blackbox-exporter appelle `http://gradio:7860/health` toutes les 15 s par le réseau Docker interne : le Cockpit admin n'a pas d'adresse publique, il n'est joignable que par le VPN Tailscale.\n\n**Lecture.** UP = HTTP 200 reçu · DOWN = pas de réponse.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "probe_success{instance=\"http://gradio:7860/health\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "N/A",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "id": 8,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RAM et disques (% libre)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "**Ce que ça mesure.** L'évolution de la mémoire et de l'espace disque libres.\n\n**Comment.** node-exporter (conteneur du VPS) lit les compteurs du système Linux ; le Prometheus du VPS les relève toutes les 15 s.\n\n**Lecture.** Une baisse continue du disque = accumulation (images, logs) : le flow de nettoyage disque tourne après chaque déploiement.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes * 100",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "RAM disponible"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"/data\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"/data\"} * 100",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "/data libre"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\"} * 100",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "/ libre"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Services scrapés par Prometheus",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "**Ce que ça mesure.** Pour chaque service du VPS, Prometheus arrive-t-il à lire ses métriques ?\n\n**Comment.** Toutes les 15 s, Prometheus appelle `/metrics` de chaque service par le réseau Docker interne ; `up` = 1 si la lecture réussit.\n\n**Lecture.** Diagnostic interne : un service peut être UP ici et injoignable par Internet (problème Caddy, DNS…) — la disponibilité vue de l'utilisateur est dans les dashboards d'accès.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "up{job=~\"cac-mlops-api|gradio-admin-vps|gradio-public-vps|node-exporter|nginx-exporter|prometheus\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mergeValues": true,
        "showValue": "never",
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        }
      },
      "id": 10,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
